@* Markup only - kept separate from _FolderTree.cshtml so it can sit on the right
   side of the layout in Index.cshtml (request Hendra 2026-08-29: position should
   match its toggle icon, which lives in the toolbar's right side) while its JS
   (updateHeaderStats, setStatsPanelCollapsed, etc.) stays in _GridView.cshtml /
   _FolderTree.cshtml - those just address these elements by id, so location in
   the DOM doesn't matter to them. *@
<aside class="dcd-stats-panel" id="dcdStatsPanel">
    <div class="dp-stats-panel-head">
        <span>Register Overview</span>
        <button type="button" class="dp-stats-panel-close" id="btn_closeStatsPanel"><i class="fa fa-times"></i></button>
    </div>
    @* Two tabs (request Hendra 2026-11-15): Overview = the register numbers, Needs Action =
       what Document Control still has to do. Needs Action sat above the grid toolbar first;
       moved here so the area around the grid stays clean. *@
    <div class="dcd-stats-tabs" id="dcdStatsTabs">
        <button type="button" class="dcd-stats-tab active" data-tab="overview">Overview</button>
        <button type="button" class="dcd-stats-tab" data-tab="action">Needs Action <span class="dcd-stats-tab-badge" id="dcdActionBadge" style="display:none;">0</span></button>
    </div>
    <div class="dp-stats-panel-body dcd-action-chips" id="dcdActionChips" style="display:none;"></div>
    <div class="dp-stats-panel-body" id="dcdStatsRow">
        <div class="dp-stat-card">
            <div class="dp-stat-card-icon blue"><i class="fa fa-file-text-o"></i></div>
            <div>
                <span>Total Documents</span>
                <b id="dcdTotal">-</b>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="dp-stat-card">
            <div class="dp-stat-card-icon green"><i class="fa fa-check-circle"></i></div>
            <div>
                <span>Effective Documents</span>
                <b id="dcdEffective">-</b>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="dp-stat-card">
            <div class="dp-stat-card-icon amber"><i class="fa fa-clock-o"></i></div>
            <div>
                <span>Need Review</span>
                <b id="dcdNeedReview">-</b>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="dp-stat-card">
            <div class="dp-stat-card-icon purple"><i class="fa fa-users"></i></div>
            <div>
                <span>Waiting Acceptance</span>
                <b id="dcdPendingAck">-</b>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="dp-stats-panel-foot">
        <a href="@Url.Action("Index", "Home")" class="dp-stats-viewall"><i class="fa fa-bar-chart"></i>View All Statistics</a>
    </div>
</aside>
